(
    title: "Entombed",
    developer: Some("Tom Sloper, Steven Sidley"),
    description: Some("Your archeologists have fallen into the catacombs of the zombies, and the maze scrolls relentlessly — keep descending or be entombed against the top of the screen. Make-breaks punch holes through walls, or build one behind you when a zombie\'s closing; blue zombies must follow the corridors, orange ones phase straight through. Two players run the catacombs together, opening passages for each other — or, as the manual cheerfully recommends, playing nasty and walling a partner in. Its procedurally generated mazes later became a small academic mystery."),
